msgid "Are you sure you want to delete this snapshot?"
msgstr "您確定要刪除這個快照嗎？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to revert to snapshot?"
msgstr "您確定要復原到這個快照嗎？"

msgid "BTRFS mode"
msgstr "BTRFS 模式"

msgid "BTRFS mode requires the root filesystem (/) to be formatted as BTRFS."
msgstr "BTRFS 模式下的根檔案系統 (/) 必須格式化為 BTRFS。"

msgid ""
"BTRFS mode requires the root filesystem to be mounted as the '@' subvolume "
"(subvol=/@)."
msgstr "BTRFS 模式下的根檔案系統必須掛載為 '@' 次儲存卷 (subvol=/@)。"

msgid "Backup destination device"
msgstr "備份目的地裝置"

msgid "Backup device"
msgstr "備份裝置"

msgid "Backup device needs to be set and applied!"
msgstr "備份裝置必須被設定並套用！"

msgid "Boot"
msgstr "啟動裝置"

msgid "Create snapshot"
msgstr "建立快照"

msgid "Creating snapshot ..."
msgstr "建立快照 ..."

msgid "Daily"
msgstr "每日"

msgid "Delete snapshot"
msgstr "刪除快照"

msgid "Deleting snapshot ..."
msgstr "刪除快照 ..."

msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "裝置"

msgid ""
"Enable when the OS root filesystem (/) is BTRFS and you want native BTRFS "
"snapshots stored on that same device. For protection against OS drive "
"failure, leave this disabled and use a separate backup device with RSYNC "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"當作業系統的根檔案系統 (/) 是 BTRFS，且您要將原生 BTRFS 快照儲存在同一裝置時，則啟用此設定。為防止作業系統磁碟機故障，則停用此功能並以"
" RSYNC 模式使用分離的備份裝置。"

msgid "Excludes"
msgstr "排除"

msgid "Failed to determine the UUID of the root filesystem."
msgstr ""

msgid "Include @home subvolume"
msgstr ""

msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "每月"

msgid "On-demand snapshots"
msgstr "依要求快照"

msgid ""
"Only applies in BTRFS mode when /home is a separate @home subvolume. When "
"enabled, @home is included in snapshots and is restored together with @. "
"Disable to snapshot and revert only @, leaving user data in @home untouched."
msgstr ""

msgid "Revert to snapshot"
msgstr "復原到快照"

msgid "Reverting to snapshot ..."
msgstr "復原到快照中 ..."

msgid "Scheduled snapshots"
msgstr "預定快照"

msgid "Set to zero to disable"
msgstr "設成 0 則停用"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Snapshot"
msgstr "快照"

msgid "Stop cron email"
msgstr "停止 cron 郵件"

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

msgid "This entry is used to create a snapshot only!"
msgstr "此輸入項目僅使用於建立快照！"

msgid "Timeshift"
msgstr "Timeshift"

msgid ""
"Use , or ; or new line to separate entries.  Will be converted to comma "
"separated.<br/>Use trailing ** to match anything, including slashes.<br/>Use"
" trailing *** will match both the directory and everything in the "
"directory.<br/>See <a href='https://linux.die.net/man/1/rsync' "
"target=_blank>rsync manual</a> for additional explanation of "
"filters.<br/>Excludes are ignored in BTRFS mode."
msgstr ""
"使用 , 或 ; 或 換行 來分隔輸入項目。將被轉換成以逗號分隔。<br/>使用尾端 ** 來符合任何字串，包含斜槓符號。<br/>使用尾端 *** "
"將符合目錄及目錄中所有項目。<br/>參見 <a href='https://linux.die.net/man/1/rsync' "
"target=_blank>rsync 使用手册</a> 中對篩選的額外解釋。<br/>在 BTRFS 模式下會忽略排除篩選。"

msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "每週"

msgid "hourly"
msgstr "每小時"
